%% D8 Sequence: refuel receipt reconciliation (chapter 3). Endpoints from routes/integrations.js, logic from src/receipts.js.
sequenceDiagram
  actor D as Жолооч (апп)
  participant API as Open Tee API
  participant W as Fuel Tank Warner
  participant G as GPSBox
  participant A as Админ вэб
  D->>API: Түлшний баримт (зураг, ШТС, литр)
